        "Soltanto in combinazione con 0.55-1 kg/ha Basagran SG."@it ;
    schema:identifier "9633" .

code:64115C2B-76FC-46C1-9875-6ABEDD92F518 a :Obligation ;
    schema:description "Nur in Tankmischung mit 0.1% Folpet 80 WDG (1.6 kg/ha) (W 5012)."@de,
